menu "Shelly relay"

    config SHELLY_CHANNELS
        int "Relay channels"
        range 1 2
        default 1
        help
            How many relays (and wall switch inputs) the board has. 1 for the
            Shelly 1, 1PM and Mini; 2 for the 2PM. The second relay's and
            switch's pins are SHELLY_RELAY2_GPIO and SHELLY_SWITCH2_GPIO in the
            variant's "Shelly board" menu.

    config SHELLY_RELAY_READBACK
        bool "Read the relay pins back"
        default n
        help
            Configure the relay pins as input and output so the diagnostics
            snapshot can show that each pad follows what was written. Does
            not change what the relay does.

endmenu
